\newlabel{fig:system}{{1}{3}{\textbf {\sys {} architecture.} The harness exposes branch events. The context tree aliases trunk pages at \texttt {fork}. Advanced prefill pruning filters each residual before GPU prefill: hash skip, draft prune, early abort, then a disaggregated-prefill gate that inserts only retained KV. Decode attends to the committed spine. Freed KV raises the number of concurrent sessions under the same HBM budget}{figure.1}{}}
