\newlabel{fig:app}{{2}{6}{\textbf {Per-branch prefill pruning.} Hash lookup, draft score, and an early prefix check run before GPU prefill. The disaggregated connector inserts only a retained residual. A loop is dropped before prefill; an illegal prefix aborts early; a replayed full block is a local hash hit and is not transferred. The winner is always retained, and decode sees only the committed spine}{figure.2}{}}
\newlabel{fig:app@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][5][]6}{}{}{}}
